# Pattern Recognition

This problem introduces the **Membership Query** pattern.

The repeated question is:

```text
Is this element present?
```

If we answer this by scanning a string every time, the solution becomes inefficient.

Instead:

```text
Store all jewels

↓

HashSet

↓

Lookup every stone

↓

O(1) average lookup
```

