# Common Mistakes

## Mistake 1

Using

```java
String.contains()
```

inside a loop.

Example

```java
if (jewels.contains(String.valueOf(stone)))
```

Each `contains()` call scans the string.

Overall complexity becomes

```text
O(J × S)
```

---

## Mistake 2

Ignoring Case Sensitivity

```text
a

≠

A
```

These are different characters.

---

## Mistake 3

Using HashMap

```java
HashMap<Character,Integer>
```

No counts or values are required.

A `HashSet` is sufficient.

